/// root plus legs plus refusal sites.
/// Disposition: historical_candidate (this row pins
/// the TestT27NoDeferredMechanismPresent offline pact
/// as reviewable Can facts; the old Go check stays
/// until the integrator retires it after every linked
/// row, variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the live run shape: the
/// test name, the twenty-two calls in Go order, the
/// five idents, the ten refusal wordings in Go order,
/// and the four site tallies.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): calls
/// pin bare callee spellings in Go order; idents pin
/// Go spellings; wordings pin Go inner bytes in Go
/// order; counts pin ints tallied from the Go span.
/// test-name pins TestT27NoDeferredMechanismPresent
/// (L166); root-call pins repoRoot (L167);
/// compile-call pins regexp.MustCompile (L172);
/// walk-call pins filepath.WalkDir (L179); is-dir-call
/// pins IsDir (L180); suffix-call pins
/// strings.HasSuffix (L183); rel-call pins relSlash
