/// the hits wording (L208); word-returning-lost pins
/// the RETURNING wording (L213); word-finally-hit
/// pins the finally wording (L235); word-markup-hit
/// pins the Markup wording (L240); word-triplet-lost
/// pins the triplet wording (L245);
/// word-catalogue-hit pins the registry wording
